NOTE: the first attempt used the Cargo Book's own example floor (rust-version = 1.62) and cargo refused the
manifest: 'rust-version 1.62 is incompatible with the version (1.85.0) required by the specified edition (2024)'.
That is itself a finding: under rust-edition = 2024 the declared floor can never be below 1.85, which bounds how
far the fallback resolver can hold a dependency back. Retrying at the lowest floor edition 2024 permits.

